; --- Institution stack: sect claims and nation offices (ADR 0083) ------------
;
; A FILLED seat and a VACANT one get visibly different cards, tints and label
; tones, because the succession design depends on a player being able to tell them
; apart at a glance. A vacancy is never rendered as a filled seat in quieter ink;
; that would have collapsed ADR 0083's three states into two.

